<title>USA: Omaha hogs $1.00-1.50 higher - USDA.</title>
<headline>Omaha hogs $1.00-1.50 higher - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>OMAHA 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were $1.00-1.50 higher. Top $55.50 per cwt. - USDA</p>
<p>US  1-3    220-260 lbs    55.00, around 100 head 55.50</p>
<p>US  2-3    260-280 lbs    54.00-54.50</p>
<p>Sows: 25 percent. Steady to 0.50 higher. Top 48.00</p>
<p>US 1-3    350-500 lbs    45.50 to mostly 46.00</p>
<p>US 2-3    500-650 lbs    47.00-48.00</p>
</text>
